# src/apps/android/app/src/test/java/com/luminet

## Purpose
Scopes host-side Android unit tests to the LumiNet application namespace.

## Contents
Contains the nested `android` package and feature-specific local tests.

## Interfaces and dependencies
Compiled in the Android module's local test source set and linked against application code and configured test doubles.

## Invariants
This directory remains test-only, package paths must match declarations, and tests should isolate external/platform effects behind deterministic doubles.